     "text": "Assuming **one adult, one-way**, Anchorage (ANC) → Seattle (SEA) on **November 14, 2026**:\n\n| Option | Advertised price | Where to book |\n|---|---:|---|\n| Alaska Airlines **Saver** | **From $238 USD** | [Alaska Airlines](https://www.alaskaair.com/en/flights-from-anchorage-to-seattle). Its opened page lists this date and fare type, but another indexed version shows $389, so the price needs confirmation at checkout. |\n| Delta Air Lines | **From $152 USD** | [Trip.com](https://www.trip.com/flights/city-anc-airport-sea/). This price is listed for your exact date, but the page does **not** confirm whether it is basic economy. |\n\nThese are **advertised fares, not verified checkout quotes**. The Alaska listing explicitly identifies Saver; the cheaper Delta listing leaves the fare category unclear. ([alaskaair.com](https://www.alaskaair.com/en/flights-from-anchorage-to-seattle?msockid=02f6d55e980c64ed37c1c3d5999d652d))\n\nFor no extras, search for your exact date and decline optional paid seats, checked bags, insurance, and upgrades. Confirm the fare type and final total before paying.\n\nSOURCES: Alaska Airlines (alaskaair.com); Trip.com (trip.com).",
